      "text": "GATEWAY — the only door\nverbs land in phases:\nP1 grants · created/duplicate ·\n    reject unknown contentClass\nP2 delete / restore / supersedes ·\n    provenance merge\nP3 near-dup check at write ·\n    contentClass in search\nP4 re-embed · confirmed override ·\n    retrieval report",
